error[SE0263]: `window:` requires `mode: realtime`
 --> tests/emit/params.sim:9:5
  |
9 |     window:   5 (s);
  |     ^^^^^^ no frames to average over
  = note: `window` sets the rolling window for `sim.utilization` and `sim.overrun_pct`, which only exist in real time (§13.6)
  = note: a batch run has no frame boundaries, so both metrics would record as zero

